WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.190
Before closing a repair, compare the original symptom with the conditions of the test.

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:13.330
Open Mark Resolved and write the repair and the observed test result in the summary; enter a root cause only if the evidence supports it.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:20.205
Confirm Resolution and read the new badge, because entering a summary without confirming is not a completed status change.
